    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="small muted">Effective and last updated: {{ legalEffectiveDate }}</p>

    <p>
      This policy explains how {{ site.legalName }} (&ldquo;Monthaven,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo;
      &ldquo;us&rdquo;), operating as {{ site.name }}, handles information you give us through
      this website, by phone, or by text.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> your name, phone number, email address,
      property address, and whatever you tell us about the property and your situation.</li>
      <li><strong>Consent records:</strong> if you provide a phone number and opt in to text
      messages, we record the consent language shown to you, its version, the page URL, and a
      timestamp. We keep these records to demonstrate compliance with messaging regulations.</li>
      <li><strong>Marketing attribution:</strong> the page you landed on, the referring site,
      and any campaign parameters in the URL (such as utm_source or gclid).</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use Google Analytics, which sets cookies and collects
      usage data such as pages viewed, approximate location, device, and browser.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To research your property and prepare a written cash offer.</li>
      <li>To contact you about that offer and, if you proceed, to coordinate closing.</li>
      <li>To send you text messages, if and only if you opted in.</li>
      <li>To understand which marketing is working.</li>
      <li>To meet legal, tax, and recordkeeping obligations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not sell or share your
      contact details with other home buyers or lead brokers.</strong> We share information
      only with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Service providers who operate this site and our forms, messaging, and analytics,
      acting on our instructions.</li>
      <li>The closing attorney, title company, and lender payoff departments, when a
      transaction is underway and only as needed to complete it.</li>
      <li>Anyone we are legally required to disclose to, such as in response to lawful process.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="small muted">
      <strong>Mobile information is never shared with third parties or affiliates for
      marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> All other categories above exclude text
      messaging originator opt-in data and consent; that information is not shared with any
      third party except as required to deliver the messages themselves.
    </p>

    <h2>Text messaging</h2>
    <p>
      If you give us a phone number and check the consent box, you agree to receive recurring
      automated marketing and informational text messages from us at that number. Consent is
      not a condition of receiving an offer or of any purchase. Message frequency varies.
      Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. See our
      <a href="/legal/sms/">SMS Terms</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reply STOP to any text message to stop receiving them.</li>
      <li>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> to ask what we hold
      about you, to correct it, or to ask us to delete it.</li>
      <li>Use your browser settings or Google's opt-out tools to limit analytics cookies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Retention and security</h2>
    <p>
      We keep inquiry records for as long as needed to respond and to meet legal and tax
      obligations, and we keep messaging consent records for as long as required to
      demonstrate compliance. We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards, but
      no method of transmission or storage is completely secure.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed to anyone under 18 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If we change this policy we will update the date above. Material changes will be
      noted on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      {{ site.legalName }}<br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a><br>
      Phone: <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
    </p>
